summary:
  A stream found dead is shown as an error and left in the player.

history:
  The heal turns back when the player says it plays, which is why a dead
  stream stayed dead: the error road reached the heal and the heal found
  a player in PlayingState. Stopping it is what lets the road go on.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
          var audition = root._healPendingUrl !== "" && _icyStreamTarget(playMusic.source) === root._healPendingUrl;
          playMusic.stop();

replace:
          var audition = root._healPendingUrl !== "" && _icyStreamTarget(playMusic.source) === root._healPendingUrl;
          playMusic.pause();

expect:
  Killed by test_invariants::test_a_stream_that_stands_is_handed_to_the_road_every_other_death_takes.
  Line-neutral.
